{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52233","headline":"颂六十二首 五十八 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 五十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大慈振法鼓，开悟无明聋。\n鑪冶心秽垢，防非如利锋。\n护鹅不惜命，守草养生同。\n五篇遮轻重，七聚荡心胸。\n晨朝宣宝偈，夕夜虔诚恭。\n近求出苦海，远念法身踪。\n七支净三业，五分满金容。\n各愿坚固戒，净土得相逢。\n（见同书卷一百七《三聚部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}